  "title": "Bacon-Wrapped Asparagus Spears with Tomatoes and Taleggio Cheese",
  "description": "Lemony asparagus spears are bundled with slices of bacon and baked with Taleggio, a soft Italian cow's milk cheese. Serve it as part of an antipasti plate or as a side dish.",
  "authors": [
